# Form Dialogs

Build create/edit dialogs with **`CustomDialog`** shell rules from [dialog-windows.mdc](mdc:.cursor/rules/dialog-windows.mdc). This rule covers **form wiring** inside the body and footer submit flow.

## Stack

- `react-hook-form` + `@hookform/resolvers/yup` + `yup`
- Validation schema in `features/<domain>/schemas/` for non-trivial forms (or colocated yup object for small dialogs)
- `@/components/ui` inputs (`Input`, `Textarea`, `Select`, `Checkbox`, `Label`) — not raw HTML controls
- Redux dispatch for persist actions; `toast` for slice errors

## Open / reset

Reset form when dialog opens from entity data:

```tsx
useEffect(() => {
  if (open) {
    form.reset(mode === "edit" && entity ? { ...entityFields } : defaultValues);
    dispatch(clearDomainError());
  }
}, [open, mode, entity, form, dispatch]);
```

## Submit

- `handleSubmit` builds payload, dispatches `createRequest` / `updateRequest`
- On success: `onOpenChange(false)`, optional `onSuccess()` callback
- Surface `error` from slice via `useEffect` + `toast.error`

## Footer (CustomDialog)

- Cancel: `variant="outline"`, `h-10`, closes dialog
- Save/Create: `variant="accent"`, `h-10`, Lucide `Save` icon `w-4 h-4 mr-2` before label
- Disable submit while `loading` from slice

## Errors

- Field errors: `formState.errors` or `Controller` + `text-destructive` helper text
- Do not put Save/Cancel in the dialog body

